Lesson_Proposals*

# Misc
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Pixi
.pixi/
*.egg-info/

# Generated reports (checker output). Anchored to the repo root: an
# unanchored `report.*` also matched checker/report.py, and the package
# build honors .gitignore, so the module was silently left out of installs.
/report.*
/*-report.md
/*-report.html
/*-report.pdf
/*-report.json

# Session handoff notes
HANDOFF.md
